{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351430","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351430","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1035143001:0":{"text":"我的丈夫德尔维克想要给安妮娅买个玩偶。","source_cn":"我的丈夫德尔维克想要给安妮娅买个玩偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x593EE243C4BE8FDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035143002:0":{"text":"圣石镇的商店中缺货，我们听说前方有一个特别的市场——","source_cn":"圣石镇的商店中缺货，我们听说前方有一个特别的市场——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D1328300CB12B2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035143003:0":{"text":"可以买到各种珍贵的东西，德尔维克就决定去碰碰运气。","source_cn":"可以买到各种珍贵的东西，德尔维克就决定去碰碰运气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D0357BC5A9A5BFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035143004:0":{"text":"我劝不动他，只能向艾雅祈祷……保佑他平安抵达，安全返回。","source_cn":"我劝不动他，只能向艾雅祈祷……保佑他平安抵达，安全返回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1E3DDDF1F501FE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:镇民菲利帕":{"text":"镇民菲利帕","source":"镇民菲利帕","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}